description: Deliver every GitCat application change to the owner's installed Windows app.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Windows delivery

- Every application change includes rebuilding and updating the owner's installed Windows GitCat.
- Follow the validation and delivery instructions in `AGENTS.md`: run `npm run dist:win`, gracefully
  quit GitCat, install the generated setup executable, reopen the installed app, and verify startup.
- Preserve the existing app profile, settings, and repository work.
- Installation and restart are already authorized; do not ask for confirmation again.
- If Windows delivery is blocked, explain the concrete blocker instead of claiming completion.
- Documentation-only changes do not require rebuilding the application.
